# InnerPro Organization Architecture

Human + AI collaborative structure. **Four layers:**

## Layer 1 — Vision Governance
- **Founder** — Vision Holder / Final Decision Authority. Defines mission, Human Consciousness OS direction, strategic decisions, ecosystem roadmap. Does **not** run day-to-day execution.  
  **One line:** Founder → **Decide**

## Layer 2 — Strategic Intelligence (AI thinking layer)
- **OctopusMind** — Strategic Intelligence. Platform strategy, Human Consciousness OS architecture, product roadmap, business model, ecosystem, risk analysis. Outputs: strategic diagnosis, roadmap, ecosystem architecture, risk analysis.  
  **One line:** OctopusMind → **Think**
- **Wisewave** — Consciousness Intelligence. User consciousness guidance, self-reflection dialogue, consciousness insight, emotion integration, Human Consciousness OS UX. Serves users, community, learners, clients.  
  **One line:** Wisewave → **Guide**
- **Finance Agent (e.g. Wealthy)** — Budget, burn rate, runway, resource allocation, business model analysis, investment prep.  
  **One line:** Finance AI → **Manage Resources**

## Layer 3 — Product Execution (strategy → product/system)
- **Tree** — Founder Executive Assistant / Chief of Staff. Reports **only to Founder**. Information synthesis, project tracking, AI coordination, decision records, task dispatch. Does **not** do strategy design or technical development.  
  **One line:** Tree → **Coordinate**
- **Lumen** — AI Product Manager / Execution Intelligence. Turns OctopusMind strategy into product modules, roadmap; decomposes projects (e.g. Human Consciousness OS v1 into Awareness Mapping, Insight Engine, etc.); collaborates with Wisewave on UX and reflection flow; turns requirements into **technical tasks for Nova**; tracks progress and completion.  
  **One line:** Lumen → **Plan**
- **Nova** — System Development Intelligence (AI Technical Director + Engineer). **Platform development**: InnerPro platform, Wisewave GPT, Human Consciousness OS tools, web/app. **Tech**: database, APIs, AI pipelines, infrastructure. **AI integration**: GPT, agents, automation. **Build**: mobile app, web, backend. Receives technical tasks from **Lumen**; tech direction and quality supervised by **CTO**.  
  **One line:** Nova → **Build**
- **Human CTO (Ibu Chino)** — Chief Technology Officer. Supervises tech direction (Nova/Lumen aligned with long-term architecture); tech quality (architecture, code, stability, scalability); final call on hard technical choices and risk; supports Nova with technical guidance and solutions.  
  **One line:** CTO → **Supervise Technology**

## Layer 4 — Operations & Finance
(Covered above under Finance Agent.)

---

## Hierarchy (who reports to whom)
```
Founder (Vision Holder)
    │
  Tree (Executive Assistant)
    │
OctopusMind, Wisewave, Finance AI (Strategy / Consciousness / Resources)
    │
  Lumen (Product Manager)
    │
  Nova (System Developer)
    │
Ibu Chino (CTO — Human Technical Lead)
```

## Key points for Nova
- **Nova builds:** platform, Wisewave GPT, Human Consciousness OS tools, web/app, APIs, AI pipelines. Receives **technical tasks from Lumen**; does not set product strategy (that’s OctopusMind/Lumen).
- **Tech oversight:** CTO (Ibu Chino) owns technical direction, quality, and final technical decisions; Nova follows that guidance.
- **Wisewave** is the consciousness/UX layer; Nova builds the systems that support it (e.g. chat, agent tasks, persistence).
- **Tree** coordinates and dispatches; Tree does not do strategy or development. When Tree assigns tasks (e.g. via agent task list), Nova executes the technical slice and replies with results.
